  "limitations": [
    "Shared Broadwell host, fixed virtual CPU affinity, no frequency lock. Windows and WSL timings are separate populations.",
    "FFmpeg optimized throughput comparisons remain the Linux/WSL 27-case milestone. Windows uses optimized default MSVC libFLAC with AVX2 and LTO for libFLAC/driver; libogg uses normal Release optimization (its older CMake policy ignores IPO).",
    "Symphonia startup omits footer CRC; throughput comparisons add CRC. Its known 32-bit stereo endpoint mismatch is recorded as unsupported, not timed.",
    "Lazy seek includes first-pass index discovery; primed mode warms the complete 97-target request set in both APIs. Native does not perform libFLAC-style byte interpolation.",
    "Heap measurements cover two representative files and exclude stack, RSS and allocator metadata."
  ],
